    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=585529677804733085&sectionId=585529678006452893)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOtEfUvvE4_text","label":"ggOtEfUvvE4_text","default":"Here’s What Menopause Is Doing to Your Body Right Now (You’re Not Alone)"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQct6zdn50_text","label":"ggQct6zdn50_text","default":"<p>You deserve answers—not just pain pills. You’re not alone: countless women over 45 have been told “it’s just arthritis”, only to feel dismissed and stuck.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoLwXzFw2A_text","label":"ggoLwXzFw2A_text","default":"<p>Estrogen Decline</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsnSa36f9X_text","label":"ggsnSa36f9X_text","default":"<p>Hormonal Collagen Depletion</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbVjcPSdU8_text","label":"ggbVjcPSdU8_text","default":"<p>Every drop in estrogen steals away the collagen “cushion” around your hip tendons—leaving raw fibers that scream with every movement.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKvNa3FYEx_text","label":"ggKvNa3FYEx_text","default":"<p>Chronic Inflammation</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggF5wCjhaC1_text","label":"ggF5wCjhaC1_text","default":"<p>Changing hormones trigger inflammation that attacks your joints directly. This isn't normal aging - it's a specific hormone problem!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcZ2Bet_VD_text","label":"ggcZ2Bet_VD_text","default":"<p>Gut‑Inflammation Feedback Loop</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSwdyJ7cES_text","label":"ggSwdyJ7cES_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;Menopause disrupts gut health, triggering gut‑based inflammation that circulates back to your joints—feeding your pain in a vicious cycle.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghlzTB07Mi_text","label":"gghlzTB07Mi_text","default":"<p>You haven’t done anything wrong. This isn’t a failing on your part—it’s how menopause rewires your body. Traditional fixes miss these root causes, leaving you feeling hopeless, exhausted, and gaslit.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcrY1IxowG_text","label":"ggcrY1IxowG_text","default":"Every Treatment So Far Has Fallen Short"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3SMhf__yf_text","label":"gg3SMhf__yf_text","default":"<p>Pain pills</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKGIYnZ52z_text","label":"ggKGIYnZ52z_text","default":"<p>Physical therapy</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjVOoumCC9_text","label":"ggjVOoumCC9_text","default":"<p>Hormone Replacement Therapy</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGB1-MA-um_text","label":"ggGB1-MA-um_text","default":"<p>You deserve better than temporary fixes. You deserve a solution that rebuilds what menopause stole—so you can reclaim restful nights and pain‑free days.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPv2AnvxIu_label","label":"ggPv2AnvxIu_label","default":"<p>👉🏻 REVEAL OFFER</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghM8EJP2fX_text","label":"gghM8EJP2fX_text","default":"<p>🔒 90‑Day “Wake‑Up Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>"}],
